<p>We are updating the <strong>Founders Beta Circle</strong> offer for the first 100 beta users.</p>

<p>
  <strong>New terms:</strong> <strong>$10/month for 6 months</strong> (1 seat), then standard subscription rates.
  Includes <strong>all bundled PolySaaS apps</strong> (Odoo, Nextcloud, Mattermost, Dolibarr, Liferay, WordPress, PolySysMon, Monitor Logger, and more as offered)
  plus entitlement to <strong>up to 3 external BYOL</strong> SaaS apps (HubSpot, Slack, Salesforce, and others you choose).
</p>

<p>
  While Founders Beta is selected on
  <a href="https://app.prod-polysaas.cloud/dose/subscribe/"><strong>Subscribe</strong></a>,
  other plans, seats, promos, and app options stay locked
  and the fee stays fixed at <strong>$10/month</strong>.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>This replaces the prior $100 one-time / 1-year promo.</strong>
  Sign up on the
  <a href="https://app.prod-polysaas.cloud/dose/subscribe/"><strong>PolySaaS Subscribe page</strong></a>,
  choose <strong>Founders Beta</strong>, and pay via Stripe.
</p>

<h3>Why we are doing this</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Final push:</strong> early founders help us harden production with real usage.</li>
  <li><strong>Proving traction:</strong> the first 100 is a clear milestone for product and investors.</li>
  <li><strong>Honest feedback:</strong> we want complaints and ideas — they shape the roadmap.</li>
</ul>

